# Scalable design

- Assume growth: paginate lists; avoid unbounded in-memory loads.
- Define timeouts, retries (idempotent only), and failure isolation on remote calls.
- Prefer async/queue for long work; keep request paths thin.
- Cache only with clear invalidation; do not cache authz decisions incorrectly.
- Add or note metrics/logs/traces for new critical paths (see feature HLD Observability).
- Avoid N+1 queries; batch where the LLD calls for it.
